{"id":"n3686f125ac","headline":"Saudi Arabia shuts down key oil pipeline, blaming drones from Iraq","summary":"Saudi Arabia has shut down its East-West oil pipeline, blaming drones from Iraq. Riyadh had increased use of the pipeline to bypass the closure of the Strait of Hormuz.","why":"The East-West pipeline is Saudi Arabia's main bypass route for crude exports that avoid the Strait of Hormuz, so its closure affects global oil supply.","category":"commodities","event_type":"energy-supply","importance":3,"flag":null,"market_moving":true,"location":{"place":"Riyadh","country":"Saudi Arabia","lat":24.71,"lon":46.68,"region":"me"},"entities":[],"links":[],"source":{"name":"the Guardian","url":"https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/sep/12/saudi-arabia-shuts-down-oil-pipeline-blaming-drones-from-iraq"},"sources":[{"name":"the Guardian","url":"https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/sep/12/saudi-arabia-shuts-down-oil-pipeline-blaming-drones-from-iraq"}],"published_at":"2026-09-12T15:35:12Z","retrieved_at":"2026-11-12T06:29:12Z","official":false,"ai_summary":true,"content_hash":"7d988009efc929bc","impacts":[],"why_moved":"Closure of the East-West pipeline, a bypass for Hormuz, tightens crude supply expectations amid the Iran conflict.","backfilled":true,"backfilled_at":"2026-11-12T06:29:12Z","backfill_provenance":{"version":"gdelt-backfill-v1","original_published_at":"2026-09-12T15:35:12Z","feed_url":"https://data.gdeltproject.org/gdeltv2/","discovered_via":"GDELT GKG 2.1","gdelt_seen":"2026-09-12T06:00:00Z","publisher_country_gdelt":"SA","description_from":"publisher page metadata"},"image":{"kind":"topic","file":"photos/gas-pipeline-3484307.jpg","alt":"gas pipeline (illustration)","credit":"JTMorkis","license":"Pixabay Content License","license_url":"https://pixabay.com/service/license-summary/","source":"Pixabay","source_url":"https://pixabay.com/photos/jacket-rig-industrial-gas-platform-3484307/"}}